---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="我的项目 | ExquisiteCore - 开发作品展示"
    description="浏览ExquisiteCore的个人项目和开发作品集。包含全栈开发、游戏开发和各种有趣的编程项目，展示技术能力和创新思维。"
    keywords="个人项目,开发作品,项目展示,全栈开发,游戏开发,编程项目,ExquisiteCore,技术作品集"
    type="website"
>
    <div class="text-center my-8">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">我的项目</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-lg">这里展示了我的一些个人项目和作品</p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <!-- 个人博客项目 -->
            <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-6 w-6"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M19 20H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h10a2 2 0 012 2v1m2 13a2 2 0 01-2-2V7m2 13a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2m-4-3H9M7 16h6M7 8h6v4H7V8z"
                            ></path>
                        </svg>
                        个人博客
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        基于现代技术栈构建的全栈个人博客系统，采用前后端分离架构设计。
                    </p>

                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
                            <div class="badge badge-primary">Astro</div>
                            <div class="badge badge-secondary">Rust</div>
                            <div class="badge badge-accent">PostgreSQL</div>
                            <div class="badge badge-ghost">Axum</div>
                            <div class="badge badge-info">TailwindCSS</div>
                            <div class="badge badge-success">Docker</div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="text-sm space-y-2">
                            <div>
                                <strong>前端：</strong> Astro + SolidJS + TypeScript
                                + TailwindCSS + DaisyUI
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>后端：</strong> Rust + Axum + Sqlx + PostgreSQL
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>部署：</strong> Docker + Docker Compose +
                                Nginx
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">主要功能：</h4>
                        <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
                            <li>• 文章管理系统</li>
                            <li>• SEO 优化</li>
                            <li>• 响应式设计</li>
                            <li>• 全文搜索</li>
                            <li>• 项目展示</li>
                            <li>• 管理后台</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card-actions justify-end mt-6">
                        <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                            <svg
                                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                class="h-4 w-4 mr-1"
                                fill="none"
                                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                            >
                                <path
                                    stroke-linecap="round"
                                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    stroke-width="2"
                                    d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"
                                ></path>
                            </svg>
                            查看博客
                        </a>
                        <a href="https://github.com/ExquisiteCore/Blog" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">
                            <svg
                                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                class="h-4 w-4 mr-1"
                                fill="none"
                                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                            >
                                <path
                                    stroke-linecap="round"
                                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    stroke-width="2"
                                    d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"
                                ></path>
                            </svg>
                            GitHub
                        </a>
                        <button
                            class="btn btn-outline btn-sm"
                            onclick="document.getElementById('blog_details_modal').showModal()"
                        >
                            <svg
                                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                class="h-4 w-4 mr-1"
                                fill="none"
                                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                            >
                                <path
                                    stroke-linecap="round"
                                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    stroke-width="2"
                                    d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"
                                ></path>
                            </svg>
                            详细介绍
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- LagrangeGo-Template 项目 -->
            <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-6 w-6"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M8 9l3 3-3 3m5 0h3M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"
                            ></path>
                        </svg>
                        LagrangeGo-Template
                        <div class="badge badge-success">维护中</div>
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        基于 LagrangeGo 的 QQ Bot
                        开发模板，为开发者提供快速上手的项目框架。
                    </p>

                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
                            <div class="badge badge-primary">Go</div>
                            <div class="badge badge-secondary">
                                Bot Framework
                            </div>
                            <div class="badge badge-accent">Template</div>
                            <div class="badge badge-ghost">TOML</div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="text-sm space-y-2">
                            <div>
                                <strong>技术栈：</strong> Go + LagrangeGo + TOML
                                + Logrus
                            </div>
                            <div><strong>协议：</strong> NTQQ PC Protocol</div>
                            <div><strong>License：</strong> AGPL-3.0</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">主要特性：</h4>
                        <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
                            <li>• 账号密码 & 扫码登录</li>
                            <li>• 私聊/群聊消息处理</li>
                            <li>• 配置文件热重载</li>
                            <li>• 模块化逻辑注册</li>
                            <li>• 完整的日志系统</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mt-6">
                        <div class="card-actions">
                            <a
                                href="https://github.com/ExquisiteCore/LagrangeGo-Template"
                                target="_blank"
                                class="btn btn-primary btn-sm"
                            >
                                <svg
                                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                    class="h-4 w-4 mr-1"
                                    fill="none"
                                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                    stroke="currentColor"
                                >
                                    <path
                                        stroke-linecap="round"
                                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                                        stroke-width="2"
                                        d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"
                                    ></path>
                                </svg>
                                GitHub
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- LagrangeGo 开源贡献 -->
            <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-6 w-6"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"
                            ></path>
                        </svg>
                        LagrangeGo
                        <div class="badge badge-info">贡献者</div>
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        NTQQ PC 协议的 Go 语言实现，为 QQ
                        机器人开发提供核心协议支持。
                    </p>

                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
                            <div class="badge badge-primary">Go</div>
                            <div class="badge badge-secondary">Protocol</div>
                            <div class="badge badge-accent">NTQQ</div>
                            <div class="badge badge-ghost">Core Library</div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="text-sm space-y-2">
                            <div>
                                <strong>协议：</strong> NTQQ PC Protocol Implementation
                            </div>
                            <div><strong>用途：</strong> QQ Bot 开发核心库</div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>贡献：</strong> 参与功能开发和问题修复
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">支持功能：</h4>
                        <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
                            <li>• 账号密码/二维码登录</li>
                            <li>• 文本/图片/语音/视频消息</li>
                            <li>• 群管理功能完整支持</li>
                            <li>• 好友/群消息事件处理</li>
                            <li>• 文件上传下载功能</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mt-6">
                        <div class="card-actions">
                            <a
                                href="https://github.com/LagrangeDev/LagrangeGo"
                                target="_blank"
                                class="btn btn-outline btn-sm"
                            >
                                <svg
                                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                    class="h-4 w-4 mr-1"
                                    fill="none"
                                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                    stroke="currentColor"
                                >
                                    <path
                                        stroke-linecap="round"
                                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                                        stroke-width="2"
                                        d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"
                                    ></path>
                                </svg>
                                GitHub
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 占位项目卡片 -->
            <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl opacity-50">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">更多项目</h2>
                    <p>更多有趣的项目正在开发中...</p>
                    <div class="card-actions justify-end">
                        <div class="btn btn-disabled btn-sm">敬请期待</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 博客详情模态框 -->
    <dialog id="blog_details_modal" class="modal">
        <div class="modal-box max-w-4xl">
            <form method="dialog">
                <button
                    class="btn btn-sm btn-circle btn-ghost absolute right-2 top-2"
                    >✕</button
                >
            </form>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">个人博客 - 技术详情</h3>

            <div class="space-y-6">
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-md mb-2">🎯 项目概述</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm">
                        这是一个采用现代技术栈构建的全栈个人博客系统，旨在提供优秀的用户体验和开发者体验。项目采用前后端分离架构，确保了良好的可维护性和扩展性。
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-md mb-2">🔧 技术架构</h4>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div class="p-4 bg-base-200 rounded-lg">
                            <h5 class="font-medium mb-2">前端技术栈</h5>
                            <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
                                <li>
                                    • <strong>Astro</strong> - 现代静态站点生成器
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    • <strong>SolidJS</strong> - 高性能响应式框架
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    • <strong>TypeScript</strong> - 类型安全
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    • <strong>TailwindCSS</strong> - 原子化CSS
                                </li>
                                <li>• <strong>DaisyUI</strong> - 组件库</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-4 bg-base-200 rounded-lg">
                            <h5 class="font-medium mb-2">后端技术栈</h5>
                            <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
                                <li>
                                    • <strong>Rust</strong> - 系统级编程语言
                                </li>
                                <li>• <strong>Axum</strong> - 异步Web框架</li>
                                <li>
                                    • <strong>Sqlx</strong> - 类型安全的SQL工具包
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    • <strong>PostgreSQL</strong> - 关系型数据库
                                </li>
                                <li>• <strong>Docker</strong> - 容器化部署</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-md mb-2">✨ 核心特性</h4>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm">
                        <div>• 响应式设计，完美适配各种设备</div>
                        <div>• SEO优化，搜索引擎友好</div>
                        <div>• 文章编辑与管理</div>
                        <div>• 全文搜索功能</div>
                        <div>• 项目作品展示</div>
                        <div>• 管理后台系统</div>
                        <div>• 暗色/亮色主题切换</div>
                        <div>• 优化的加载性能</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-md mb-2">🚀 部署方案</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm mb-2">
                        项目支持多种部署方式，推荐使用Docker进行生产环境部署：
                    </p>
                    <div class="mockup-code text-xs">
                        <pre><code># 一键启动所有服务
docker-compose up -d

# 包含前端、后端、数据库、Nginx反向代理</code></pre>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-md mb-2">🔮 未来规划</h4>
                    <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
                        <li>• 评论系统</li>
                        <li>• RSS订阅</li>
                        <li>• 标签分类</li>
                        <li>• 文章统计分析</li>
                        <li>• API接口扩展</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </dialog>
</Layout>
